[{"answer":"Excuse me!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry, but could I bother you for just a minute?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I left a book in this carrel last night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you just take a look in the shelf for me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. What's the title?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh... \"Fundamentals of Bioengineering\" or something like that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I forget the exact title.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/8.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why I need it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/9.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a sort of green paperback.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Looks like a couple of other folks've left their books in here, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Why don't they put them back where they got them when they're through, anyway?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Probably just forgot, like me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It's easy to forget a book in there after you've been sitting here going through books for three or four hours at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I guess. I've done that, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/15.mp3"},{"answer":"How about, um... \"Engineering Basics\"?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Is this it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/17.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not green, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/18.mp3"},{"answer":"It's kind of, uh, turquoise?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh! That's kind of eerie, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That's really pretty close.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/21.mp3"},{"answer":"No, not mine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Nothing else there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Nope. Just a couple of works on Anglo-Saxon grammar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Want those?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Haha, I don't think so!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I probably need one on English grammar, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/27.mp3"},{"answer":"My paper on GM is not organized very well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/28.mp3"},{"answer":"GM? General Motors?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/29.mp3"},{"answer":"No. Gene modification.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/30.mp3"},{"answer":"It's due next Tuesday and I'm barely half-finished.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/31.mp3"},{"answer":"And I need that book to check the pagination, I'm including some quotes out of it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, sorry I can't help, it's just not here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you check the stacks?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, 'cause I thought at first I'd put it back.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/35.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's not where it's supposed to be, at least.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe somebody else's got it then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Somebody from your class maybe?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, maybe. We've all got papers due.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you check at the desk?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/40.mp3"},{"answer":"They can tell you if it's been checked out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/41.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it can't be checked out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Our prof put it on reserve until the end of the term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Too many people might need to use it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/44.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's only one copy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/45.mp3"},{"answer":"That's pretty rough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yup, I think so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Or... no, actually, I have no idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I just presumed there was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll go check the catalogue!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, there might be another one in the Science Reading Room or the Medical Library.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/51.mp3"},{"answer":"You know the author?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh... Jamison, or um, Jamiston. Why?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Because I can search it for you right now, Google Scholar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, haven't you heard?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/56.mp3"},{"answer":"University Libraries has linked up with Google's search of library holdings all over the world","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Just a sec.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Jamison?...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And the title's something about bioengineering,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/61.mp3"},{"answer":"so keyword 'bioengineering'...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and, voila!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/63.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Jamison, H.J., Fundamental Concepts of Bioengineering\",","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/64.mp3"},{"answer":"is that it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes! Great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And... lessee... Tennyson University... yes, here we are:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Main Library, and Medical Research Library!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/68.mp3"},{"answer":"They've got a copy there, too, it says.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That is really great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks so much for your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry I took up so much of your time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I really appreciate this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/73.mp3"},{"answer":"My pleasure. It's my major.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Library Science.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/76.mp3"},{"answer":"You just gave me a little practicum","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Ha, well, glad to help, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got to go!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/79.mp3"},{"answer":"The Medical Library closes for the weekend Saturday afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Better run, then!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks again! Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Good luck!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-10-2023-02-03-22-22-56/83.mp3"}]
